{"language":"en-US","title":"Casanova, Last Love","overview":"Year 1763. Forced into exile, the famous libertine Giacomo Casanova leaves Paris and travels to London, where he meets Marianne de Charpillon, a young prostitute to whom he is so attracted that he forgets about the other women."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Au XVIIIe siècle, Casanova, connu pour son goût du plaisir et du jeu, arrive à Londres après avoir dû s’exiler. Dans cette ville dont il ignore tout, il rencontre à plusieurs reprises une jeune courtisane, la Charpillon, qui l’attire au point d’en oublier les autres femmes. Casanova est prêt à tout pour arriver à ses fins mais la Charpillon se dérobe toujours sous les prétextes les plus divers. Elle lui lance un défi, elle veut qu’il l’aime autant qu’il la désire."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/14r9xkcPiWrbltmjFUl2iHye3tW.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/svDBHdJ37rDYZM0vvvJxZULbt5r.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":504605,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/14r9xkcPiWrbltmjFUl2iHye3tW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/14r9xkcPiWrbltmjFUl2iHye3tW.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/14r9xkcPiWrbltmjFUl2iHye3tW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/14r9xkcPiWrbltmjFUl2iHye3tW.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x9PRnPapFyv2dNqwKXDlE6VImqz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x9PRnPapFyv2dNqwKXDlE6VImqz.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3BaFWAAgg74b8veZvm8uEv7pcjI.jpg